OL,12,G0310 The Perfect Pitch
OL,13,     FThe campers end their tour of
OL,14,     FNorth Wales at The Oyster Farm
OL,15,     FCaravan Site on Ynys Mon with
OL,16,     Foyster gin and an aquatic tour of
OL,17,     FPuffin Island, before they pick
OL,18,     Ftheir perfect pitch.
